1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,786
The Dragon Boat Festival is a fun holiday

2
00:00:02,793 --> 00:00:05,785
We eat zongzi which are made of sticky rice

3
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:08,025
We watch dragon boat races

4
00:00:08,032 --> 00:00:10,231
The boats are long and colorful

5
00:00:10,233 --> 00:00:13,586
My family hangs calamus and mugwort on the door

6
00:00:13,673 --> 00:00:15,785
These plants bring good luck

7
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:20,071
We also wear perfume pouches to ward off evil spirits

8
00:00:20,073 --> 00:00:25,282
I Love the Dragon Boat Festival because it is full of excitement and traditions

